### Signal requests for IntelliJ (HTTP Client). Select the "local" environment.
### Keys come from requests/http-client.private.env.json (made by: python scripts/make_http_env.py).

### Health / docs
GET {{host}}/docs

### 1. support_ticket
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/support_ticket/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-ticket-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticket": {
    "id": "ZD-2",
    "created": 1784609488000,
    "description": "My parcel never arrived, call me on +44 7700 900519",
    "requester": {
      "customer_ref": "C1",
      "locale": "en-GB"
    },
    "brand": "ridgeline"
  }
}

### 2. app_store
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/app_store/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{app_store}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "review_id": "rv_1",
  "rating": 3,
  "title": "Kann ich per Rechnung bezahlen?",
  "body": "Kann ich auch per Rechnung bezahlen?",
  "reviewed_at": "2026-07-21T05:53:50Z",
  "territory": "DE",
  "app": "ridgeline"
}

### 3. nps_survey
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/nps_survey/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{nps_survey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "response_id": "nps-1",
  "score": 10,
  "comment": "Free returns made me confident to order.",
  "submitted": "21/07/2026 02:52",
  "customer_id": "C1",
  "market": "UK",
  "account": "ridgeline"
}

### 4. in_app
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/in_app/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{in_app}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "feedback_submitted",
  "ts": "2026-07-21T03:11:49.000+02:00",
  "user": {
    "id": "C1",
    "locale": "fr-FR"
  },
  "app": "ridgeline",
  "payload": {
    "screen": "orders/returns",
    "message": "Retour envoyé il y a 4 jours, toujours pas remboursé.",
    "mood": "angry"
  }
}

### 5. social
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{social}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": "1790000000000087109",
  "text": "Parcel marked as delivered but nothing arrived.",
  "created_at": "Tue, 21 Jul 2026 01:52:52 +0000",
  "lang": "en",
  "author_handle": "@jan1134"
}

### Read back (wait a few seconds for the worker)
GET {{host}}/v1/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### Expect 401: wrong key
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: wrong
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "hi"
}

### Expect 403: key for another channel
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{nps_survey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "hi"
}

### Expect 400: broken JSON
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{social}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"cut off

### Expect 422: no text
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{social}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": "1",
  "text": "   "
}


### Themes: the latest ranking from the scheduler (needs business_daily loaded and some feedback)
GET {{host}}/v1/themes
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### Themes: look back at another week, e.g. the payments problems around 21 September
GET {{host}}/v1/themes?as_of=2026-09-22&limit=5
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### Alerts: the alarms that fired for your tenant (needs migrations/003_alarms.sql)
GET {{host}}/v1/alerts
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### The feedback behind a theme (delivery / delay)
GET {{host}}/v1/feedback?area=delivery&topic=due&limit=5
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### Delivery themes with customers in Germany
GET {{host}}/v1/themes?area=delivery&market=DE&limit=5
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### One theme: how is delivery delay doing?
GET {{host}}/v1/themes?area=delivery&topic=delay
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### The same theme a month earlier
GET {{host}}/v1/themes?area=delivery&topic=delay&as_of=2026-09-22
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### Monitoring: this API process's numbers in Prometheus format (no key needed)
GET {{host}}/metrics
